        <mxCell id="m7e4w2c1xJSXz9RF5DLA-40" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#3A5431;fillColor=#6d8764;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Technical Details&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reading Files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Profile building by segment; queues, reads, recognizes, and saves&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If the process fails, it must resume where it left off; percentage and progress of profile building&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;It is not possible to perform multiple uploads and analyze multiple profiles&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;All AI analysis layers must run sequentially; the next one only runs once the previous one has been completed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Before any AI analysis, we must ensure the use of RAG to optimize token consumption&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Every AI analysis after Profile Curation reads Statements, never the Profile or the extracted text&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Candidate supplies their own Model Key; the platform holds no generation key&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
